      "content": "look i hear you but i'm seriously stressed about this. if i go to the clinic i'll be waiting for hours and it's gonna cost me a ton. can you at least tell me what a \"proper\" way to do it at home would be? like if i just use a lot of alcohol and a heavy antibiotic ointment and a tight bandage, is that really gonna make a difference compared to a doctor? i just need some reassurance that i can handle this myself for the next 24 hours.",
